1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,960
Hi everyone. Today we are diving into

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,880
Blitz mode. The core feature of Blitz

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:07,040
that helps you get into a flow state and

4
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,840
stay fully focused like a productivity

5
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:11,120
pro. This mode is built to help you

6
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,880
eliminate distractions and work on one

7
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,200
task at a time. Instead of juggling

8
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,199
multiple things, Litz mode keeps you

9
00:00:17,199 --> 00:00:19,240
focused, making your workday more

10
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:21,680
productive. To start blitz mode, first

11
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,720
add your task to today column in order

12
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,920
priority, the top being the most

13
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:28,160
