16
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,520
showing your top task in a lifetime with

17
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:37,320
the rest of your tasks neatly lined up

18
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:40,000
below. From here, you get a bird's eye

19
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,840
view of your day while tackling tasks

20
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:44,239
one by one. You can easily rearrange

21
00:00:44,239 --> 00:00:46,719
tasks by dragging them, add new tasks on

22
00:00:46,719 --> 00:00:49,440
