but you can skip it or mark it as done.

28
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,920
Or you can set another task live by

29
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:06,080
hitting the rocket button next to it. It

30
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:07,760
jumps right into the timer so you can

31
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:09,600
start working on it while keeping the

32
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,400
previous task waiting for your comeback

33
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:13,760
below. You can also see the tasks you've

34
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:15,280
completed during the session to track

35
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:17,119
your progress.

36
00:01:17,119 --> 00:01:18,880
In case you have tasks across different

37
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:20,799
lists, you can use the list drop down at

38
00:01:20,799 --> 00:01:22,640
