39
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:25,040
between your lists quickly. You can

40
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,960
select the all lists view to see all the

41
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:28,799
tasks from all the lists assigned for

42
00:01:28,799 --> 00:01:31,600
today at the same time. Here you can see

43
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,799
the gear icon you can use to open

44
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:35,840
preferences. That's where you can tweak

45
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:37,280
settings like which screen the focus

46
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:39,119
panel appears on if you have multiple

47
00:01:39,119 --> 00:01:41,520
monitors and whether it sits on the left

48
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:44,000
or right side of the screen. It's all

49
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,000
about making Blitz mode fit your setup

50
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,040
perfectly. Below you can see more

51
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,880
settings you can customize like setting

52
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:53,920
up the Pomodoro timer, break duration,

53
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:56,079
time alerts, and other aspects of your

54
00:01:56,079 --> 00:01:58,560
workflow with Blitzet. When you are

55
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,399
done, just click the home icon at the

56
00:02:00,399 --> 00:02:02,240
