57
00:02:02,240 --> 00:02:04,640
home screen.

58
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:06,320
If you want to keep your timer always

59
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:07,840
visible without distracting you from

60
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,679
your work, click the arrow icon at the

61
00:02:09,679 --> 00:02:11,599
top right or the focus mode button at

62
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:13,520
the bottom to minimize the focus panel

63
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:16,239
into the floating timer. You can drag it

64
00:02:16,239 --> 00:02:18,160
anywhere on your screen and it always

65
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:20,080
stays on top so you're always reminded

66
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:22,560
