67
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,959
includes several controls. You can take

68
00:02:24,959 --> 00:02:26,800
a quick break with a countdown based on

69
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:29,120
your preferences. You can add quick

70
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,520
notes to your

71
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:33,440
task. You can pause and resume the timer

72
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:37,000
as needed. Move to the next task

73
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,319
instantly. Mark the current task as

74
00:02:39,319 --> 00:02:41,840
complete and you can return to the full

75
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:44,280
focus panel with the resize icon on the

76
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:46,800
right. When you finish a task, click

77
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,840
done. It feels great to check things

78
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:51,760
